{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.amana.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "叫到下一个试镜的人",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.amana.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.amana.first",
    "idolId": "amana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "请——多指教☆",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这边才是，请多指教。首先，能告诉我你的名字吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "好——大崎甘奈，17 岁哦！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "试镜的孩子大多会紧张，大崎倒是很有精神啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "诶嘿，在学校也常被这么说☆",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。大崎在学校是什么样的？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "嗯——和朋友聊时装啊，放学后去逛街什么的！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "啊，最近迷上自拍了☆",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "学校听起来很开心呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "当然！还有，常被问打扮得这么辣妹是为什么。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "这也是因为，想全力享受只有现在才能做的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（不只是打扮，连活法都有自己的一套的孩子啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，能说说你参加这次试镜的理由吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "这个啊，是因为想和甜花一起当偶像！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "甜花……啊，在资料里见过。是姐姐吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "对对！甜花可——可爱了！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "甜花要是当了偶像，大家都会被她迷得团团转的！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "大崎很喜欢姐姐呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "当然，最喜欢了☆",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真是叫人羡慕的姐妹情。不过，现在是在面试你，也可以说点别的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "诶嘿，说得也是。唔，是问志愿理由对吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "甘奈呢，是想和甜花一起当偶像，一起闪闪发光！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "这样不行吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当偶像，比你想的要辛苦得多哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "不要紧！甘奈不是说着玩的。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "既然要做就要认真做。也不想给支持甘奈的事务所添麻烦。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（哦，意外地很认真啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（作为偶像的魅力足够，性格看起来也很扎实。）",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（感情好的双胞胎偶像吗……嗯，也许不错。）",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "大崎，试镜，你合格了。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "诶，真的？甘奈，合格了？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯！今后就一起加油吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "amana",
        "text": "太好了！这边才是，请多指教——！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-11-02T09:00:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T09:00:00.000Z",
